  "description": "Zero-dependency, pure-C# HTML-to-PDF for .NET 8. Renders modern CSS (flexbox, grid, gradients,\n      transforms), SVG, PDF/A (incl. PDF/A-3 hybrid invoices with embedded XML — EU Factur-X / ZUGFeRD)\n      and PDF/UA, a built-in QR-code generator, and right-to-left scripts (Arabic, Hebrew) — no headless\n      browser or Chromium, no native binaries, no AGPL. Cross-platform (Windows/Linux), in-process,\n      ideal for serverless / Azure Functions.",
